Package: com.yourname.volumechordrecorder
Name: VolumeChordRecorder
Version: 0.0.24
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: SpringBoard-only recorder driven by a volume up/down chord: the action happens the moment
 both buttons go down - that starts or stops an audio recording, and a hold past the configured hold
 time switches it to video with selectable quality and an optional microphone channel. Voice
 recordings take a selectable codec, sample rate, channel count and AAC bitrate. Includes a recordings
 manager, haptics, and optional upload to Telegram.
Maintainer: yourname
Author: yourname
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
